(text "USB-INPUT-GATE-01 v0.2 - power switch and independent AUX supply" (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3590f092-6a9e-5a96-a58c-56c67d434ce4"))
(text "SOURCE_ALLOW must remain LOW until a >=1.5A source budget is verified. No SDP/unknown-source permission.\nAUX_3V3 is now an OUTPUT from U202, independent of main gate. Source policy and battery charge permit are external.\nNo PCB or hardware validation. This is not a complete 2S charger." (at 25.4 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "048d1ed1-7859-5c42-9504-04759af84f30"))
(text "OFF discharges OUT internally; never backfeed from the 2S pack, traction or another USB supply.\n5.55V clamp is conditional, NOT a universal transient ceiling: existing core contract ends at 5.5V.\nEP shown as pin 7; connect to GND and verify thermal footprint before PCB layout." (at 25.4 275 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "83f6b60e-59ed-5a07-b978-16622a244750"))
(text "U202 EN intentionally floating for auto-start: TI SBVS186H 7.4. Never tie EN to raw VBUS.\nAUX load target <=10mA; not a current limiter or source/brownout qualification. No XIAO/camera/servo load." (at 279.4 195.58 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bfc896a2-3659-5a6d-a97e-b063aa79d3cd"))
